          "Name": "Can not be less than zero",
          "Order": null,
          "ValidationRule": "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-16\"?><ValidationRule xmlns:i=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\" i:type=\"MinNumberValidationRule\" xmlns=\"http://schemas.intelex.net\"><_localizedMessages xmlns:d2p1=\"http://schemas.microsoft.com/2003/10/Serialization/Arrays\"><d2p1:KeyValueOfstringstring><d2p1:Key>en-US</d2p1:Key><d2p1:Value>The value for {Field.Caption} should be more than {Rule.MinNumber}</d2p1:Value></d2p1:KeyValueOfstringstring><d2p1:KeyValueOfstringstring><d2p1:Key>pt</d2p1:Key><d2p1:Value>O valor para {Field.Caption} deve ser maior do que {Rule.MinNumber}</d2p1:Value></d2p1:KeyValueOfstringstring><d2p1:KeyValueOfstringstring><d2p1:Key>de</d2p1:Key><d2p1:Value>Der Wert für \"{Field.Caption}\" muss größer als {Rule.MinNumber} sein.</d2p1:Value></d2p1:KeyValueOfstringstring><d2p1:KeyValueOfstringstring><d2p1:Key>zh</d2p1:Key><d2p1:Value>{Field.Caption} 的值应大于 {Rule.MinNumber}</d2p1:Value></d2p1:KeyValueOfstringstring><d2p1:KeyValueOfstringstring><d2p1:Key>es</d2p1:Key><d2p1:Value>El valor de {Field.Caption} debe ser mayor que {Rule.MinNumber}</d2p1:Value></d2p1:KeyValueOfstringstring><d2p1:KeyValueOfstringstring><d2p1:Key>fr</d2p1:Key><d2p1:Value>La valeur de {Field.Caption} doit être supérieure à {Rule.MinNumber}.</d2p1:Value></d2p1:KeyValueOfstringstring></_localizedMessages><MinNumber>0</MinNumber></ValidationRule>"
        },
        "LocalizationData": null,
