                "HtmlMessage": "<p>The following Nonconformance has been prevented and requires your approval. You must approve by {#Workflow.DueDate}.<br /><br /></p><p>Status: <span class=\"workflow-message\" id=\"WorkflowStatus\">Approval</span></p><div class=\"t-paste-container\">Location: {#Location}</div><div class=\"t-paste-container\"><br /></div><div class=\"t-paste-container\">Record No.: {#RecordNo}</div><div class=\"t-paste-container\"><br /></div><div class=\"t-paste-container\">Title: {#Name}</div><div class=\"t-paste-container\"><br /></div><div class=\"t-paste-container\">Description: {#Description}</div><div class=\"t-paste-container\"><br /></div><div class=\"t-paste-container\">Category: {#Category}</div><div class=\"t-paste-container\"><br /></div><div class=\"t-paste-container\">Process: {#Process}</div><div class=\"t-paste-container\"><br /></div><div class=\"t-paste-container\"><p>Is this a valid Nonconformance? : {#vNonconformance}</p><p>Use 8D Methodology: {#Use8DMethod}</p><p>Number of Days Opened: {#NumofDaysOpened}</p></div><div class=\"t-paste-container\">Coordinator Notes: {#CoordinatoNotes}</div><div class=\"t-paste-container\"><br /></div><div class=\"t-paste-container\">Team Leader: {#TeamLeader}</div><div class=\"t-paste-container\"><br /></div><div class=\"t-paste-container\">Priority: {#Priority}</div><div class=\"t-paste-container\"><br /></div><div class=\"t-paste-container\">Summary: {#Summary}</div><div class=\"t-paste-container\"><br /></div><div class=\"t-paste-container\"><p>Effectiveness of Corrective Actions: {#CorrectiActions}  </p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.75em;line-height:1.5;\">   </span></p></div><div class=\"t-paste-container\">Due Date: {#Workflow.DueDate} </div><div class=\"t-paste-container\"><br /></div><div class=\"t-paste-container\">Person Responsible: {#Workflow.PersonResponsible}</div><div class=\"t-paste-container\"><br /></div><div class=\"t-paste-container\">Date Reported: {#DateCreated} </div><div class=\"t-paste-container\">--------------------------------------------------------</div><div class=\"t-paste-container\"><br /></div><div class=\"t-paste-container\"><a href=\"{#System.Link}\">Please login to view full details of the report.<a></div><p><br /></p>",
