                "HtmlMessage": "<p>The following Nonconformance has been validated. You were assigned as the team to investigate this Nonconformance.<br /><br /></p><p>Status: Definition</p><p>Location: {#Location}</p><p>Record No.: {#RecordNo}</p><p>Title: {#Name}</p><p>Description: {#Description}</p><p>Category: {#Category}</p><p>Process: {#Process}</p><p>Is this a valid Nonconformance? : {#vNonconformance}</p><p>Use 8D Methodology: {#Use8DMethod}</p><p>Number of Days Opened: {#NumofDaysOpened}</p><p>Coordinator Notes: {#CoordinatoNotes}</p><p>Team Leader: {#TeamLeader}</p><p> </p><p></p><p></p><p>Due Date: {#Workflow.DueDate} </p><p></p><p>Assigned By: {#Workflow.ModifiedBy}</p><p>Date Reported: {#DateCreated}</p><p></p><p>--------------------------------------------------------</p><p><a href=\"{#System.Link}\">Please login to view full details of the report.<a></p>",
                "PlainTextMessage": null,
                "Priority": null,
                "ReplayTo": null,
                "SenderName": null,
                "Subject": "Nonconformance {#RecordNo} has been Validated.",
